          cta: 'See the packages',
        },
        {
          k: '08',
          t: 'A brief with a considered first reply',
          d: 'The project brief is not a form into the void: your brief reaches me instantly through more than one channel, and a considered first reply comes back within minutes, reading your situation and giving you a step you can take today, followed by my personal reply within 24 hours.',
          href: `${p}/brief/`,
          cta: 'Try the brief',
        },
        {
          k: '09',
          t: 'Under the hood',
