        { t: 'Book a diagnosis session', d: 'If you got this far and it is serious: tell me about your project and let us find exactly where it leaks.', href: `${p}/brief/` },
      ],
      guideDone: 'Your path',
      roadTitle: 'Where is it going?',
      roadSub: 'The site keeps growing. This is the road ahead, with no fake dates:',
      road: [
        { t: 'New articles and games', d: 'Signals keeps expanding: new topics, each with its own game.', now: true },
        { t: 'Two services in the making', d: 'Data analysis and AI systems and automation: their pages are ready and you can join the waitlist today.', now: true },
        { t: 'Client accounts', d: 'A login that lets every client follow their project: where the work stands, and what is next.', now: false },
        { t: 'A live dashboard', d: 'Your project numbers (campaigns, visits, results) in one board you open anytime, instead of monthly reports that get lost.', now: false },
        { t: 'Smarter lab tools', d: 'More interactive tools that analyse and suggest, built on the same try-before-you-decide philosophy.', now: false },
      ],
      nowTag: 'Live now',
      soonTag: 'On the map',
      ctaTitle: 'The site itself is the work sample.',
      ctaBody: 'Everything you saw on this page, I designed and built. If you want this level for your project (a website, an identity, or a full marketing system), let us start with a diagnosis.',
